402 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I am writing to express my interest in the Production Engineering Specialist \023 Project Coordinator position at ABB in Germany\056 With a background in mechanical engineering and experience supporting industrial operations and international tunnelling projects\054 I am motivated to contribute to ABB\031s production and engineering environment while continuing to grow within a global industrial organization\056\n\nIn my recent role as Project Engineer at Herrenknecht Tunnelling Services\054 I supported the coordination and monitoring of mechanical and industrial equipment across international projects\056 My work involved technical inspections\054 performance analysis\054 and collaboration with multidisciplinary teams to improve equipment reliability and operational efficiency\056 Through this experience\054 I developed a strong understanding of industrial systems\054 field operations\054 and the importance of structured project coordination in complex environments\056\n\nI am particularly interested in roles that combine engineering and coordination\054 where I can contribute to operational performance and project execution within production environments\056 Additionally\054 I have exposure to continuous improvement practices and I am currently expanding my knowledge of SAP systems to strengthen my capabilities in industrial operations\056\n\nI am highly motivated to develop my career in Germany and contribute to ABB\031s engineering excellence\056 I am comfortable working in English and I am actively improving my German language skills to better integrate into the local working environment\056 I am available for relocation and eager to contribute with a hands\055on and resilient approach\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 403 0 R
     /Pg 392 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

